  "title": "Forum needs to save drafts!",
  "content": "<p>The old forum used to save drafts of replies.</p><p>So, when this happened:</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/6992c87d-609d-4d9d-86cc-58e50c4e09c9.png\" /></figure><p> </p><p>You could try again - and not lose everything you typed.</p><p>This worked whether it was a forum error, a network error, user error (closing the page before hitting ‘Send’) or whatever.</p><p> </p><p>We <strong>really </strong>need this feature back - I have just lost <strong>two </strong>posts!</p>",
